    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ object repersenting NAIF spice CK Segment and it&apos;s metadata. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>CK kernels consist of multiple CK segments. These specifically define a type 3 CK segment which consists of two parallel arrays of ephemeris times and orientations as SPICE quaternions.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>: <ulink url="https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/pub/naif/toolkit_docs/C/cspice/q2m_c.html">https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/pub/naif/toolkit_docs/C/cspice/q2m_c.html</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
